{"unit_id":"xiaoshenming__dsh-session-surgeon#card-zh","repo":"xiaoshenming/dsh-session-surgeon","commit":"3da26706e88e7f825925d52cbf2cfa53c2ae3808","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-surgeon 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的会话管理插件，可在 Web 面板、CLI 和 agent 工具中使用。它接入 DSH 工具注册与 Web 路由，提供本机会话扫描、结构检查、修复预览与应用、压缩以及 JSONL 导出。用户可在面板查看会话并复制 ID；修复和压缩默认先预览，应用修复会先创建备份。适合需要找回无法打开的会话、检查日志问题或整理和导出本地会话的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；可通过 DSH_SESSION_ROOT 或 DSH_HOME 指定本机会话目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:123-189","src/find.mjs:15-20","src/encode.mjs:70-70"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoshenming__dsh-session-surgeon#card-en","repo":"xiaoshenming/dsh-session-surgeon","commit":"3da26706e88e7f825925d52cbf2cfa53c2ae3808","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-surgeon manages DSH sessions through a Web panel, CLI, and agent tools. It scans, inspects, repairs, compacts, and exports logs. Repair defaults to preview and backs up files before writing. No API key is required; DSH_SESSION_ROOT or DSH_HOME selects the session directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:123-189","src/find.mjs:15-20","src/encode.mjs:70-70"]}
